Portions of this product are adapted from third-party work:

  * usim/slime/cotrain_loop.py composes Slime's placement-group, rollout-manager
    and training-actor APIs and follows the structure of Slime's train.py and
    train_async.py. patches/slime_cotrain_combined.patch modifies Slime source
    files. Slime is licensed under the Apache License 2.0,
    Copyright 2025 Zhipu AI.

  * usim/cooperbench/agent.py translates the mini-swe-agent-v2 prompt templates
    shipped with CooperBench (src/cooperbench/agents/mini_swe_agent_v2/config/
    mini.yaml) into Python. data/cooperbench/*.json contain task and feature
    descriptions taken from the CooperBench dataset. CooperBench is licensed
    under the MIT License.

  * human_study/tasks/tau2_retail.yaml and human_study/tasks/tau2_airline.yaml
    are rendered from tau2-bench task definitions, and the human-study backend
    calls tau2-bench environments and tools. tau2-bench is licensed under the
    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Sierra Research.

  * human_study/frontend/src/components/Markdown.tsx follows the heading, list
    and paragraph styles of OpenHands (https://github.com/All-Hands-AI/OpenHands),
    MIT License.

  * data/p4g/ contains the Persuasion for Good corpus in ConvoKit format
    (Wang et al., 2019; https://gitlab.com/ucdavisnlp/persuasionforgood,
    converted by the ConvoKit developers) and per-dialogue files derived from
    it. The corpus is licensed under the Apache License 2.0. See
    data/README.md.

